{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a solo rogue-like card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the ruins, uncovering fragments of power and purpose along the way. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612900?t=1743224837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/966522e4e1bc2c98c323686f737cd1d07758236d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743224837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/89bbf9fc2cd5e40aef1556b170148fe65259dd9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743224837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/89bbf9fc2cd5e40aef1556b170148fe65259dd9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743224837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"LOST ALTR contains themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all players. This includes dark esoteric symbolism, references to ritual practices, bloodletting, and self-sacrifice. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a solo rogue-like card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the ruins, uncovering fragments of power and purpose along the way. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>","developers":["ALTER-BOY"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612900/7d1986904c88fa25735d936e7b3f2d0a093f1cfa/header.jpg?t=1743224837","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 ALTER-BOY STUDIO. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\nAll other trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"LOST ALTR","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit proce